Each Foundation of the non-default bases has an effect of reducing all deployed Cat units' damage taken from a specific trait. Similarly, each Style component gives [[Special Abilities#Resist|Resistance]] against a specific ability. These effects are only unlocked when each part is upgraded to level 1; just building them will not give any effects in battle. The percentages for effects of all Foundation and Style types begin from 0.75% at level 1 and increase by 0.75% per level up to 15% at level 20. Note that Foundations do not reduce damage taken by the base.

Target Trait resistance and Wave/Surge resistance can stack: for example, against [[Red EnerG]], with the Waterblast Style and Foundation equipped, his Surge damage would be reduced to 72.25% of his base damage, and direct hit damage to 85%.

